      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Naples_Park%2C_Florida",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1957, Collier County Commissioners approved a county‑wide public library system, with Naples as the central station and a traveling bookmobile.",
